      "adaptation": "Official Ayu base palette hues without generated luminance variants: accent.tint, editor background/text, surface.base, orange keywords, peach/pink operators, purple numbers, gray comments. All RGB colors are opaque; upstream alpha is removed, not applied to text. Native glass and artwork rendering are unchanged."
